[03/17 22:45:35     37s]     #-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03/17 22:45:35     37s]     # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
[03/17 22:45:35     37s]     # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
